# utf16_registra: examples/utf16/registra.exsc, one of 27 UTF-8 -> UTF-16 libraries.
# METHOD: the WHATWG Encoding Standard decoder as a byte-at-a-time machine over explicit registers. Its own header says how it gets the maximal subpart right.
#
# THE UNIT is contractus.exsc (the interface) + registra.exsc + probatio.exsc (the one
# driver all 27 libraries are linked with), in that order, as sources= names it.
# THE INPUT is tests/data/utf16_corpus_L.bin: framed test cases, each in both modes
# (strict, and U+FFFD per maximal subpart) -- every boundary scalar, every single
# byte, a Table 3-7 walk, every byte value at every mid-sequence position, the
# 4096-byte capacity edges, seeded fuzz. THE GOLDEN is tests/data/utf16_expected_L.bin, and
# it is the SAME file for every library: written by Python's codec
# (tests/utf16/oracle.py), not by any Exsecutor program, and cross-checked there
# against a hand-written WHATWG decoder. Regenerate both with
#   python3 tests/utf16/corpus.py write tests/data
#
# MEASURED 2026-10-03 with tests/run.sh's own run_program_tests, run IN ISOLATION (a
# temporary copy of the script with the other phases' calls deleted: the full script
# cannot go green on the host that wrote this, where clang cannot link UBSan's
# runtime): compiles and assembles, exit 0, stdout byte-identical to the golden,
# syscall surface within {Mundus, ambitus}. That run found 182 program directories
# (154 before these 28) and passed 696 checks (584 before), 0 failed: exactly four
# new checks per directory. The C-backend differential PHASE was not run for
# these; tests/utf16/matrix.py --c built each library with gcc and clang at -O0 and
# -O2 (clang with -fsanitize-trap) and matched the golden on the fixture.
#
# The cross phase is not opted into: no qemu on the host that wrote this, so a
# big-endian mips64 run of it is [UNTESTED]. The C-backend differential phase is
# on, as for every directory without c-differentia=.
TEST: expect-exit=0 sources=examples/utf16/contractus.exsc,examples/utf16/registra.exsc,examples/utf16/probatio.exsc stdin=tests/data/utf16_corpus_L.bin stdout=tests/data/utf16_expected_L.bin
